|cfffcdc00friend you can skip this step and ask them to remove it for you|r\nK\t\t1475\t1\t2359\t\nK\t\t2251\t6\t93\t\nN\t\t6452\t<\t1\nS\tRogue\t\toptional=1;completewith=TowerKey\nM\t\t|cfffcdc00==PAY ATTENTION TO THE UPCOMING SECTION==|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Press Escape, then go into -> Options -> Controls|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Check \"Enable Interact Key\" and bind the \"Interact with Target\" option to a key|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Additionally, it's recommended you enable Enemy Nameplates (Default Key: V) as it allows you to see enemies behind some of the corners inside the tower|r\nS\tRogue\t\t\nG\t\tWestfall\t68.5\t70.08\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Agent Kearnen|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00You MUST do this quest your|r [Poisons]\nT\t\t2360\tTurn in Mathias and the Defias\nA\t\t2359\tAccept Klaven's Tower\nS\tRogue\t\tlabel=TowerKey;loop=1\nG\t\tWestfall\t71.49\t73.49\t0\t\t\nG\t\tWestfall\t71.01\t75.72\t0\t\t\nG\t\tWestfall\t69.58\t73.07\t0\t\t\nG\t\tWestfall\t71.49\t73.49\t30\t0\t\nG\t\tWestfall\t71.01\t75.72\t30\t0\t\nG\t\tWestfall\t69.58\t73.07\t30\t0\t\nI\t\t[Pick Pocket] the |cffff5722Malformed Defias Drone|r. Loot it for the |cff00bcd4Defias Tower Key|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00You must be in|r [Stealth] |cfffcdc00to use|r [Pick Pocket]\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00The |cffff5722Malformed Defias Drone|r spawns at the entrance to the tower, then patrols around the outside of it|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Be careful as he deals a LOT of damage. If your|r [Stealth] |cfffcdc00breaks, quickly use|r [Sprint] |cfffcdc00and run away|r\nC\t\t2359\t2\t\nI\t\tClick HERE for a video guide\nS\tRogue\t\toptional=1;completewith=Mortwake\nM\t\t|cfffcdc00Equip the|r [Curvewood Dagger] |cfffcdc00for this quest if you don't already have a|r [Dagger] |cfffcdc00equipped|r\nU\t\t15396\t\nN\t\t15396\t\t1\nS\tRogue\t\tlabel=Mortwake\nG\t\tWestfall\t70.42\t74.03\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Travel up to 2nd top floor of the tower. Whilst in|r [Stealth] |cfffcdc00and the |cffff5722Defias Tower Sentries|r aren't next to you, Jump onto th