cdc00Avoid running on the main road as much as possible. Enemies will only spawn if you're on the road|r\nC\t\t5321\t2\t\nQ\t\ton\t5321\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Liadris Moonriver|r\nG\t\tAshenvale\t27.26\t35.58\t\t\t\nT\t\t5321\tTurn in The Sleeper Has Awakened\nQ\t\tcomp\t5321\nS\t\t\tlabel=tower\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Delgren the Purifier|r\nG\t\tAshenvale\t26.19\t38.69\t\t\t\nT\t\t967\tTurn in The Tower of Althalaxx\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Delgren the Purifier|r\nG\t\tAshenvale\t26.19\t38.69\t\t\t\nA\t\t970\tAccept The Tower of Althalaxx\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Orendil Broadleaf|r\nG\t\tAshenvale\t26.43\t38.59\t\t\t\nA\t\t1010\tAccept Bathran's Hair\nX\t\t<\t20\t\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t31.25\t30.7\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cffff5722Dark Strand Cultists|r, |cffff5722Dark Strand Adepts|r, |cffff5722Dark Strand Enforcers|r and |cffff5722Dark Strand Excavators|r. Loot them for the |cff00bcd4Glowing Soul Gem|r\nI\t\tBe patient, this item has a low droprate\nC\t\t970\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t33.01\t21.41\t50\t0\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t29.53\t24.33\t40\t0\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t31.89\t22.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tOpen the |cffdb2eefPlant Bundles|r on the ground. Loot them for |cff00bcd4Bathran's Hairs|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00They look like small brown sacks. They can be hard to see|r\nC\t\t1010\t1\t\nQ\t\ton\t1010\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t31.25\t30.7\t\t\t\nX\t\t\t20\t-1650\t\tKeep killing |cffff5722Dark Strand mobs|r untill you have enough xp to reach level 20\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Delgren the Purifier|r\nG\t\tAshenvale\t26.19\t38.69\t\t\t\nT\t\t970\tTurn in The Tower of Althalaxx\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t31.89\t22.53\t\t\t\nX\t\t\t20\t\t\tGrind to level 20\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Orendil Broadleaf|r\nG\t\tAshenvale\t26.43\t38.59\t\t\t\nA\t\t1010\tAccept Bathran's Hair\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t33.01\t21.41\t50\t0\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t29.53\t24.33\t40\t0\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t31.89\t22.53\t\t\t\nI\t\tOpen the |cffdb2eefPlant Bundles|r on the gro