o finish the escort|r\nT\t\t729\tTurn in The Absent Minded Prospector\nQ\t\ton\t729\nS\t\t\tlabel=prospectorEscort\nG\t\tDarkshore\t35.72\t83.69\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Prospector Remtravel|r. This will start an escort\nA\t\t731\tAccept The Absent Minded Prospector\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00This quest is VERY difficult. Skip this step if you're unable to find a group or solo it|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Click here for a video guide|r\nS\t\t\trequires=prospector\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Escort |cff00ff25Prospector Remtravel|r through the Excavation|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00This quest is VERY difficult. Skip this step if you're unable to find a group or solo it|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Click here for a video guide|r\nC\t\t731\t1\t\nQ\t\ton\t731\nS\t\t\toptional=1;completewith=Murkdeep\nI\t\tKill |cffff5722Encrusted Tide Crawlers|r and |cffff5722Reef Crawlers|r. Loot them for their |cff00bcd4Fine Crab Chunks|r\nC\t\t1138\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDarkshore\t31.25\t87.42\t\t\t\nI\t\tClick the |cffdb2eefBeached Sea Creature|r\nA\t\t4733\tAccept Beached Sea Creature\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00This quest can be VERY difficult. Engage the |cffff5722Murlocs|r 1 by 1, otherwise you may agro multiple at the same time|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Click here for a video guide|r\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDarkshore\t31.23\t85.56\t\t\t\nI\t\tClick the |cffdb2eefBeached Sea Turtle|r\nA\t\t4732\tAccept Beached Sea Turtle\nS\t\t\toptional=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t31.69\t83.7\t\t\t\nI\t\tClick the |cffdb2eefBeached Sea Turtle|r\nA\t\t4731\tAccept Beached Sea Turtle\nS\t\t\toptional=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t32.64\t80.71\t\t\t\nI\t\tClick the |cffdb2eefBeached Sea Creature|r\nA\t\t4730\tAccept Beached Sea Creature\nS\t\t\toptional=1;label=Murkdeep\nG\t\tDarkshore\t35.43\t76.57\t0\t\t\nG\t\tDarkshore\t35.43\t76.57\t60\t0\t\nG\t\tDarkshore\t36.64\t76.53\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Make sure you check if |cffff5722Murkdeep|r is already up in the water (if someone has previously failed the encounter or left the |cffff5722Greymist Hunter|r in the wave that he spawns with alive)|r\nI