  { name = "21-23 Ashenvale/Stonetalon", title = "21-23 Ashenvale/Stonetalon", group = "Alliance 20-30", faction = "Alliance", lo = 21, hi = 23, next = "23-24 Wetlands", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance Hunter",
    steps = "S\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Shindrell Swiftfire|r\nG\t\tAshenvale\t34.67\t48.83\t\t\t\nT\t\t1008\tTurn in The Zoram Strand\nA\t\t1134\tAccept Pridewings of Stonetalon\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Shindrell Swiftfire|r\nG\t\tAshenvale\t34.67\t48.83\t\t\t\nT\t\t1008\tTurn in The Zoram Strand\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t36.51\t50.36\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Maluressian|r\nI\t\tStable your pet. You will tame an |cffff5722Ashenvale Bear|r and a |cffff5722Ghostpaw Runner|r shortly\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t34.8\t50.8\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Haljan Oakheart|r\nV\t\tvendor\t|cff38c040Restock on Ammo, |cfffcdc00make sure you have at least 10-15 stacks as the next section is a grindy and there won't be any ammo vendor to restock|r|r\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=taming\nI\t\tSave up to 6 |cff00bcd4Gooey Spider Legs|r looted from the |cffff5722Spiders|r in the zone. You will need them for a quest later\nK\t\t2251\t6\t93\t\nS\tHunter\t\tlabel=taming\nG\t\tAshenvale\t39.74\t69.35\t\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t34.07\t55\t0\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t36.26\t59.53\t0\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t37.53\t64.17\t0\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t41.98\t67.39\t0\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t32.01\t54.29\t0\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t30.16\t51.93\t0\t\t\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00TIP:|r You can pre place a [Freezing Trap] in front of you before you pull the mob to tame to take less damage\nI\t\t|cffff5722Ashenvale Bears|r |cfffcdc00spawn closer to the Talondeep Path,|r |cffff5722Ghostpaw Runners|r |cfffcdc00share spawns with|r |cffff5722Wildthorn Stalkers|r |cfffcdc00which spawn south and west of Astranaar|r\nI\t\tIf you can't find any wolves try to use [Eagle Eye] to look for one\nV\t\ttrain\t|cfffcdc00Cast|r [Tame Beast] |cfffcdc00on a |cffff5722Ashenvale Bear|r. Attack mobs with it to learn|r [Claw (Rank 3)]\nV\t\ttrain\t|cfffcdc00Cast|r [Tame Beast] |cfffcdc00on a |cffff5722Ghostpaw Runner|r. Attack mobs with it to learn|r [Bite (Rank 3)]\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Click here for more info about pet training|r\nS\tHunter\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t36.51\t50.36\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Maluressian|r\nI\t\tWithdraw your pet from the Stable\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Raene Wolfrunner|r\nG\t\tAshenvale\t36.61\t49.58\t\t\t\nT\t\t1023\tTurn in Raene's Cleansing\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tDestroy [Teronis' Journal]. You no longer need it\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Pelturas Whitemoon|r\nG\t\tAshenvale\t37.36\t51.79\t\t\t\nT\t\t1034\tTurn in The Ruins of Stardust\nS\tHunter\t\tcompletewith=Stonetalon\nM\t\t|cfffcdc00Use|r [Beast Training] |cfffcdc00to teach your pet|r [|cff00ff25Bite (Rank 3)|r] |cfffcdc00and/or|r [|cff00ff25Claw (Rank 3)|r]\nI\t\tPlaying with only [|cff00ff25Bite|r] is the easiest as your pet will not spend all its focus and be able to [|cff00ff25Growl|r] more consistently at a small damage loss |cfffcdc00(recomended for beginner/casual players)|r\nI\t\tPlaying with only [|cff00ff25Claw|r] plays the same as having both damage spells but provides less damage and burst threat so is not reommended unless your pet can't train [|cff00ff25Bite|r]\nI\t\tPlaying with both [|cff00ff25Bite|r] and [|cff00ff25Claw|r] is the optimal damage setup but is harder to play with since your pet might cast [|cff00ff25Claw|r] instead of [|cff00ff25Growl|r] at times. |cfffcdc00(recommended if you like to min/max, you should manually cast [|cff00ff25Growl|r] with this setup)|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Keep in mind not all pets can train both|r [|cff00ff25Bite|r] |cfffcdc00and|r [|cff00ff25Claw|r] |cfffcdc00and you might have limited options due to your pet choice|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Click here for more info about pet training|r\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=Stonetalon\nI\t\tSave up to 6 |cff00bcd4Gooey Spider Legs|r looted from the |cffff5722Spiders|r in the zone. You will need them for a quest later\nK\t\t2251\t6\t93\t\nS\t\t\tlabel=Stonetalon\nG\t\tAshenvale\t42.5\t71.7\t\t\t\nZ\t\tStonetalon Mountains\tTravel to Stonetalon Mountains\nS\t\t\tsticky=1;completewith=wyv1\nI\t\tKill |cffff5722Young Pridewings|r. Loot them for their |cff00bcd4Pridewing Venom Sacs|r\nC\t\t1134\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Ziz Fizziks|r\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t58.99\t62.6\t\t\t\nA\t\t1093\tAccept Super Reaper 6000\nL\t\t22\t\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Kaela Shadowspear|r\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t59.9\t66.84\t\t\t\nT\t\t1070\tTurn in On Guard in Stonetalon\nA\t\t1085\tAccept On Guard in Stonetalon\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Gaxim Rustfizzle|r\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t59.52\t67.15\t\t\t\nT\t\t1085\tTurn in On Guard in Stonetalon\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Gaxim Rustfizzle|r\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t59.52\t67.15\t\t\t\nA\t\t1071\tAccept A Gnome's Respite\nL\t\t22\t\nS\t\t\tsticky=1;label=sr6000\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t62.36\t53\t60\t0\t\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t66.73\t51.91\t60\t0\t\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t66.75\t45.42\t60\t0\t\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t66.73\t51.91\t60\t0\t\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t62.36\t53\t\t\t\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t66.73\t51.91\t0\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cffff5722Venture Co. Operators|r. Loot them for the |cff00bcd4Blueprints|r\nC\t\t1093\t1\t\nQ\t\ton\t1093\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t62.36\t53\t60\t0\t\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t66.73\t51.91\t60\t0\t\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t66.75\t45.42\t60\t0\t\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t66.73\t51.91\t60\t0\t\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t62.36\t53\t\t\t\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t66.73\t51.91\t0\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cffff5722Venture Co. Deforesters|r and |cffff5722Venture Co. Loggers|r\nC\t\t1071\t1\t\nC\t\t1071\t2\t\nQ\t\ton\t1071\nS\t\t\tlabel=wyv1\nX\t\t\t22\t+6700\t\tGrind |cffff5722Goblins|r to level 22 and 6700+xp\nS\t\t\tlabel=sturnin;requires=sr6000\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t58.99\t62.6\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Ziz Fizziks|r\nT\t\t1093\tTurn in Super Reaper 6000\nQ\t\tcomp\t1093\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Gaxim Rustfizzle|r\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t59.52\t67.15\t\t\t\nT\t\t1071\tTurn in A Gnome's Respite\nQ\t\tcomp\t1071\nS\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25G