tals|r cast|r [Frost Nova]|cfffcdc00. Pay attention to your breath timer if you dive underwater to kill them|r\nK\t\t12220\t5\t1016\t\nS\t\t\t\nU\t\t5456\t|cfffcdc00Use the|r [Divining Scroll] |cfffcdc00to create the|r [Divined Scroll]\nC\t\t1016\t1\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t49.79\t67.21\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Sentinel Velene Starstrike|r\nT\t\t1016\tTurn in Elemental Bracers\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t50.08\t59.94\t70\t0\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t53.75\t63.49\t70\t0\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t54.17\t61.69\t70\t0\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t56.45\t63.62\t70\t0\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t50.08\t59.94\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cffff5722Foulweald Warriors|r, |cffff5722Foulweald Totemics|r, |cffff5722Foulweald Ursas|r and a |cffff5722Foulweald Den Watcher|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Be careful as the|r |cffff5722Foulweald Ursas|r |cfffcdc00can|r [Thrash] |cfffcdc00hitting you 3 times at once|r\nI\t\tThe |cffff5722Foulweald Totemics|r share spawns with |cffff5722Foulweald Warriors|r. You may have to backtrack and kill respawns if you weren't lucky with the spawns\nC\t\t1025\t4\t\nC\t\t1025\t3\t\nC\t\t1025\t2\t\nC\t\t1025\t1\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nM\t\t|cfffcdc00Be careful about|r |cffff5722Horde Guards|r |cfffcdc00as you're making your way to Azshara. Theres two camps of guards (marked on your map) near the road next to Splintertree outpost that you can bodypull if not careful|r\nI\tHunter\t|cfffcdc00Use|r [Track Humanoids] |cfffcdc00and watch your minimap to more easily spot where the guards are located|r\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t66.65\t82.19\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill the |cffff5722Shadethicket Oracle|r. Loot it for the |cff00bcd4Fallen Moonstone|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00This quest can be hard. Kite it along the road east toward Azshara|r\nC\t\t1035\t1\t\nS\t\t\tlabel=Azshara\nG\t\tAzshara\t11.9\t77.57\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Be careful about|r |cffff5722Horde Guards|r |cfffcdc00as you're making your way to Azshara. Theres two camps of guards (marked on your map) near the road next to Splintertree outpost that you can bodypull if not careful|r\nI\t\tYou may encounter a |cffff5722Warsong Outrider|r patrolling the road north-east of Splintertree Post. |cfffcdc00You don't have to run around it as it's passive and will not attack you if you don't attack it first|r\nI\tHunter\t|cfffcdc00Use|r [Track Humanoids] |cfffcdc00and watch your minimap to more easily spot where the guards are located|r\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Jarrodenus|r\nP\t\tAzshara\tGet the Azshara flight path\nS\t\t\t\nH\t\tHearth to Astranaar\nI\t\t|cff38c040Buy food/water if needed|r\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAzshara\t11.9\t77.57\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Jarrodenus|r\nF\t\tAshenvale\tFly to Ashenvale\nW\t\tAzshara\t1\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t36.61\t49.58\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Raene Wolfrunner|r\nT\t\t1025\tTurn in An Aggressive Defense\nS\t\t\tsticky=1;completewith=TomeTwo\nI\t\tSave up to 6 |cff00bcd4Gooey Spider Legs|r looted from the |cffff5722Spiders|r in the zone. You will need them for a quest later\nK\t\t2251\t6\t93\t\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nG\t\tAshenvale\t34.69\t44.3\t30\t0\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t35.43\t41.46\t30\t0\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t36.28\t38.48\t30\t0\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t36.83\t37.56\t30\t\tTravel to Thistlefur Village. Follow the Arrow for a shortcut\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t36.06\t36.59\t0\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t37\t33.77\t0\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t35.88\t31.9\t0\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t38.73\t36.32\t0\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t36.06\t36.59\t60\t0\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t37\t33.77\t60\t0\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t35.88\t31.9\t60\t0\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t38.73\t36.32\t60\t0\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t39.59\t36.31\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cffff5722Dal Bloodclaw|r. Loot him for his |cff00bcd4Skull|r\nI\t\t|cffff5722Dal Bloodclaw|r |cfffcdc00patrols Thistlefur Village|r\nC\t\t1054\t1\t\nS\t\t\tsticky=1;completewith=TomeTwo\nI\t\tKill and loot |cfffcdc00Ghostpaw Runners|r you encounter while questing. Keep any [|cff00bcd4Lean Wolf Flanks|r] you get. You will need 10 for a cooking quest later\nK\t\t1015\t10\t\t\nS\t\t\tlabel=TomeTwo;completewith=next\nG\t\tAshenvale\t27.5\t60.76\t8\t\tClimb the hill next to the big tree to the right of the Fire Scar Shrine entrance\nI\t\tJump over the tree root and hug the right to avoid aggroing mobs\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t27.4\t63.03\t70\t0\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t25.27\t60.68\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cffff5722Ilkrud Magthrull|r. Loot him for his |cff00bcd4Tome|r\nI\t\t|cffff5722Ilkrud Magthrull|r |cfffcdc00will cast|r [Ilkrud's Guardians] |cfffcdc00which is a 5 second long cast and will summon 2 Voidwalkers. Stop this cast if you're able to|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Clear an exit path if needed so you can reset them along with the |cffff5722Succubus|r if needed|r\nC\t\t973\t1\t\nS\t\t\tsticky=1;completewith=AshenEnd\nI\t\tSave up to 6 |cff00bcd4Gooey Spider Legs|r looted from the |cffff5722Spiders|r in the zone. You will need them for a quest later\nK\t\t2251\t6\t93\t\nS\t\t\tsticky=1;completewith=AshenEnd\nI\t\tKill and loot |cfffcdc00Ghostpaw Runners|r you encounter while questing. Keep any [|cff00bcd4Lean Wolf Flanks|r] you get. You will need 10 for a cooking quest later\nK\t\t1015\t10\t\t\nS\t\t\tlabel=AshenEnd\nG\t\tAshenvale\t26.19\t38.69\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Delgren the Purifier|r\nT\t\t973\tTurn in The Tower of Althalaxx\nQ\t\tcomp\t973\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next\nM\t\tDie and respawn at the Spirit Healer\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t36.61\t49.58\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Raene Wolfrunner|r\nT\t\t1054\tTurn in Culling the Threat\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t37.36\t51.79\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Pelturas Whitemoon|r\nT\t\t1035\tTurn in Fallen Sky Lake\nQ\t\tcomp\t1035\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=BoatWetlands\nG\t\tAshenvale\t34.85\t50.87\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Haljan Oakheart|r\nI\t\t|cff38c040Buy|r [Flint and Tinder] |cff38c040and|r [Simple Wood]\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Only do this if you have meat to cook while on the boat to Wetlands soon. There is a quest in Duskwood which requires your|r [Cooking] |cfffcdc00to be 50|r|r\nK\t\t4471\t1\t\t\nK\t\t4470\t1\t\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tAshenvale\t