rols around the outside of it|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Be careful as he deals a LOT of damage. If your|r [Stealth] |cfffcdc00breaks, quickly use|r [Sprint] |cfffcdc00and run away|r\nC\t\t2359\t2\t\nS\tRogue\t\toptional=1;completewith=Mortwake\nM\t\t|cfffcdc00Equip the|r [Curvewood Dagger] |cfffcdc00for this quest if you don't already have a|r [Dagger] |cfffcdc00equipped|r\nU\t\t15396\t\nN\t\t15396\t\t1\nS\tRogue\t\tlabel=Mortwake\nG\t\tWestfall\t70.42\t74.03\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Travel up to 2nd top floor of the tower. Whilst in|r [Stealth] |cfffcdc00and the |cffff5722Defias Tower Sentries|r aren't next to you, Jump onto the chair, then onto the lamp, then onto the bookshelf on top of the waypoint location|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Manually|r [Unstealth]|cfffcdc00, then press your \"Interact with Target\" keybind to open the |cffdb2eefDuskwood Chest|r. Loot it for|r |cff00bcd4Klaven Mortwake's Journal|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00NOTE: Your|r [Stealth] |cfffcdc00will temporarily stop working after looting|r |cff00bcd4Klaven Mortwake's Journal|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Be prepared to run if you don't kill the |cffff5722Defias Tower Sentries|r on the 2nd floor. They will most likely aggro you permanently (but not attack you) when you are on top of the bookshelf as it is an evade spot|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00If you have a|r [Dagger] |cfffcdc00in your bags or equipped, you can cast|r [Ambush] |cfffcdc00on the |cffff5722Defias Tower Patrollers|r and |cffff5722Defias Tower Sentries|r inside to kill them instantly. Be prepared to run after you kill the first |cffff5722Defias Tower Sentry|r and remember you can be hit from above. This is slower, but a LOT safer|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Be careful as the |cffff5722Malformed Defias Drone|r and |cffff5722Defias Drones|r can be at the entrance of the tower if you have to run out of it|r\nC\t\t2359\t1\t\nS\t!Dwarf Rogue\t\tsticky=1;label=AntiVenomStart\nK\t\t6452\t1\t\tCraft an [Anti-Venom]\nN\t\t6452\t<\t1\nV\t\ttrain\tTrain your spells\nS\t!Dwarf Rogue\t\toptional=1;requi