pular grinding spot for mages and may be constested. If you feel like there's too much competition you can complete this objective in the Roland's Doom area (cave, marked on your map)\nC\t\t222\t1\t\nC\t\t222\t2\t\nS\t\t\tlabel=worgenGrind\nG\t\tDuskwood\t62.33\t81.77\t0\t\t\nG\t\tDuskwood\t61.3\t74.36\t0\t\t\nG\t\tDuskwood\t65.1\t73.91\t0\t\t\nG\t\tDuskwood\t64.14\t68.49\t0\t\t\nX\t!Druid\t\t31\t+38100\t\tGrind until 38100/50800 xp into level 31\nX\tDruid\t\t31\t+43180\t\tGrind until 43180/50800 xp into level 31\nI\t\tKill |cffff5722Nightbane Worgens|r until your Hearthstone cooldown is <25 minutes\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00If you know that you will be leveling in one session or generally not getting a lot of rested experience up to level 38, consider grinding to level 32 instead. This will help you reach a level 38 xp gate that is required later on|r\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDuskwood\t62.33\t81.77\t0\t\t\nG\t\tDuskwood\t61.3\t74.36\t0\t\t\nG\t\tDuskwood\t65.1\t73.91\t0\t\t\nG\t\tDuskwood\t64.14\t68.49\t0\t\t\nI\t\tKeep killing |cffff5722Nightbane Worgens|r. Untill you loot [|cff00bcd4An Old History Book|r]\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Don't start the quest for it yet|r\nK\t\t2794\t1\t337\t\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDuskwood\t62.33\t81.77\t0\t\t\nG\t\tDuskwood\t61.3\t74.36\t0\t\t\nG\t\tDuskwood\t65.1\t73.91\t0\t\t\nG\t\tDuskwood\t64.14\t68.49\t0\t\t\nM\t\tKeep killing |cffff5722Nightbane Worgens|r until your Hearthstone cooldown is <25 minutes\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00This step will autocomplete when your HS cooldown is low enough to continue|r\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tDuskwood\t28.86\t30.77\t\t\t\nI\t\tClick |cffdb2eefEliza's Grave Dirt|r to summon |cffff5722Eliza|r\nI\t\tKill |cffff5722Eliza|r. Loot her for the |cff00bcd4Embalmer's Heart|r\nI\t\t|cffff5722Eliza|r |cfffcdc00will cast|r [Frostbolt] |cfffcdc00and|r [Frost Nova] |cfffcdc00along with summoning multiple|r |cffff5722Guards|r\nI\tHunter/Mage/Warlock/Priest\t|cfffcdc00You can avoid dealing with |cffff5722Eliza's Guards|r by using the Wagon to jump on top of |cff00ff2