cus on killing and interrupting the casts of |cffff5722Sleeby|r, |cffff5722Znort|r and |cffff5722Feeboz|r before killing|r |cffff5722Fozruk|r\nI\t\t|cffff5722Fozruk|r |cfffcdc00can be CC'd. Be careful as he periodically casts|r [Ground Tremor] |cfffcdc00stunning all targets within 20 yards of him for 2 seconds|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00Their patrol path is marked on your map|r\nI\tHunter\t|cfffcdc00Cast|r [Eagle Eye] |cfffcdc00to try and find|r |cffff5722Fozruk|r\nI\tWarlock\t|cfffcdc00After you deleash the kobolds and have only|r |cffff5722Fozruk|r |cfffcdc00on you kill him by keeping him|r [Feared]\nC\t\t652\t1\t\nI\tHunter/Warlock\t|cfffcdc00Click here for video reference|r\nI\t\tClick here for a reference video about splitpulling\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t36.07\t58.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tClick on the |cffdb2eefKeystone|r\nI\t\t|cfffcdc00If you are still in a group, hand in this quest while with your party! |cffff5722Thenan|r, a level 42 Elite will spawn. You can either kill him or run away and reset him if you're solo|r\nT\t\t652\tTurn in Breaking the Keystone\nQ\t\tcomp\t652\nS\t\t\t\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t36.07\t58.09\t\t\t\nI\t\tClick on the |cffdb2eefKeystone|r\nA\t\t653\tAccept Myzrael's Allies\nQ\t\tdone\t652\nS\t\t\tcompletewith=next;group=1\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t29.6\t63.68\t0\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cffff5722Marez Cowl|r. Loot her for her |cff00bcd4Head|r\nI\t\t|cffff5722Marez Cowl|r |cfffcdc00has 2 different spawn locations. One is on the high ground location, and the other is below behind the house. They are marked on your map|r\nI\tHunter\t|cfffcdc00Cast|r [Eagle Eye] |cfffcdc00to try and find which location she is in|r\nC\t\t684\t1\t\nQ\t\ton\t684\nS\t\t\tgroup=1\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t26.03\t65.66\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cffff5722Otto|r and |cffff5722Lord Falconcrest|r. Loot them for their |cff00bcd4Heads|r\nC\t\t685\t1\t\nC\t\t685\t2\t\nQ\t\ton\t685\nS\tHunter/Druid/Rogue\t\tsolo=1\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t29.6\t63.68\t0\t\t\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t29.48\t64.15\t20\t